sleef
------------------------------------------
In this library, functions for evaluating some elementary functions are
implemented. The library also includes DFT subroutines.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libsleef-devel-3.9.0-1bl1
  libsleef3-3.9.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/shibatch/sleef

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/shibatch/sleef/archive/refs/tags/3.9.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sleef-3.9.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sleef-3.9.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sleef-3.9.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sleef-3.9.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsleef3-3.9.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsleef-devel-3.9.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(sleef)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/sleef.README
  /usr/share/doc/sleef/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/sleef/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/sleef/README.adoc

(libsleef3)
  /usr/bin/cygsleef-3.dll
  /usr/bin/cygsleefdft-3.dll
  /usr/bin/cygsleefquad-3.dll
  /usr/bin/cygsleefscalar-3.dll

(libsleef-devel)
  /usr/include/sleef.h
  /usr/include/sleefdft.h
  /usr/include/sleefquad.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/sleef/sleefConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/sleef/sleefConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/sleef/sleefTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/sleef/sleefTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libsleef.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libsleefdft.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libsleefquad.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libsleefscalar.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/sleef.pc

